{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968340/extras/3077d2a79104f34e543289b823e5ad56.webp?t=1759849373\" width=524 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aliens have arrived...and <strong>YOU</strong> are in the cockpit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take flight through the foggy spot-lit skies of 1950s B-movie Americana in this interstellar arcade action romp! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your laser to lure the gullible humans out of their hiding places and then pull them up into your ship. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the quota to move on to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968340/extras/5fa0a0e111495c3c7c32e292da553dd8.webp?t=1759849373\" width=571 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assault humanity alone or partner up with a fellow invader. Co-operate  or  compete to capture the most filthy bipeds in a single session (don't forget about the cows)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The power to destroy is in your hands now...those <strong>FOOLISH EARTHLINGS</strong> won't know what hit them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968340/extras/3a9bee35551775ac6b44823208e8c8c8.webp?t=1759849373\" width=418 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3968340?t=1759849373","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968340/e8d33df978de9ce1a565fe496b991bd09eb4f100/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759849373","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968340/c03d996ceb34456a691eec9c5e30f8ddcb531a4a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759849373","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968340/c03d996ceb34456a691eec9c5e30f8ddcb531a4a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759849373","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4049340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968340/extras/3077d2a79104f34e543289b823e5ad56.webp?t=1759849373\" width=524 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aliens have arrived...and <strong>YOU</strong> are in the cockpit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take flight through the foggy spot-lit skies of 1950s B-movie Americana in this interstellar arcade action romp! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your laser to lure the gullible humans out of their hiding places and then pull them up into your ship. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the quota to move on to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=